{"id":55960,"imdb":"tt0049866","en":"Toto, Peppino, and the Hussy","orig":"Totò, Peppino e la... malafemmina","ar":null,"tag":null,"ov":"Antonio, Peppino and Lucia are three brothers who live in the country near Naples. Lucia's son, Gianni, goes to Naples to study medicine, but there he knows a ballet dancer. They fall in love and, when she goes to Milan, Gianni follows her. Informed of this and afraid that their nephew will stop studying, the three Caponi brothers leave for Milan to persuade Gianni to come back and continue studying and abandon the \"Malafemmina\" (bad girl).","rd":"1956-08-23","rt":101,"g":[35,10749],"lang":"it","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"D.D.L.","logo":null,"c":"IT"}],"countries":["IT"],"langs":["English","Spanish","Italian"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"IT","d":"1956-08-23"}],"dir":["Camillo Mastrocinque"],"prod":["Renato Libassi","Isidoro Broggi"],"wri":["Nicola Manzari","Sandro Continenza","Edoardo Anton","Francesco Thellung"],"mus":["Lelio Luttazzi"],"dop":["Mario Albertelli"],"cast":[{"n":"Totò","ch":"Antonio Caponi","p":"/x8sM4HlITfhAoXJ2FZrQA7wFgXg.jpg"},{"n":"Peppino De Filippo","ch":"Peppino Caponi","p":"/kGRGCzGrgeClFhzFoFB9bFMDDtz.jpg"},{"n":"Dorian Gray","ch":"Marisa Florian","p":"/ntHn2hjkFZbCAaAWzBWPXyrY2mv.jpg"},{"n":"Teddy Reno","ch":"Gianni Caponi","p":"/y92oMmevDYz2lSgNb7qeJMpsfJy.jpg"},{"n":"Vittoria Crispo","ch":"Lucia Caponi","p":"/e8HKlb2DS9yiBMMjuVZ1Qu4JuaT.jpg"},{"n":"Mario Castellani","ch":"Mezzacapa","p":"/5JvMyzESLdsIA4gTGZ0OzTEnvNu.jpg"},{"n":"Nino Manfredi","ch":"Raffaele","p":"/iFJ9i6GGJ4romvuF922mZNROPKW.jpg"},{"n":"Linda Sini","ch":"Gabriella","p":"/78XGNU3EJbA6OyteALvKiUOlvuy.jpg"},{"n":"Salvo Libassi","ch":"amico di Marisa","p":"/gpuaPwCfOp1ZTckwN6KbY2Twv5T.jpg"},{"n":"Luisa Ciampi","ch":"la figlia di gianni e Marisa","p":null},{"n":"Corrado Annicelli","ch":"il duca","p":"/1NYzcZU5w1ShEgoj6nyxxhVrWyO.jpg"},{"n":"Edoardo Toniolo","ch":"Remo","p":"/A8cL5CN4HF6KoEbISjKm2bra4yn.jpg"},{"n":"Gianna Cobelli","